<title>FRANCE: France OTC share trading to launch Sept 23.</title>
<headline>France OTC share trading to launch Sept 23.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's stock markets association (SBF) said on Tuesday an over-the-counter share trading facility would be launched on September 23.</p>
<p>Negotiation, delivery, settlement and data dissemination will use SBF-Paris Bourse systems, the SBF said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
